        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.132,
            0.347,
            0.926,
            0.39
          ],
          "content": "**2. For each of the statements given below, think and identify if it is Always True, Only Sometimes True, or Never True. Share your reasoning.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.162,
            0.392,
            0.796,
            0.412
          ],
          "content": "**(a) If a person says ‘0’, then they are the tallest in the group.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.162,
            0.415,
            0.715,
            0.434
          ],
          "content": "**(b) If a person is the tallest, then their number is ‘0’.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.437,
            0.541,
            0.456
          ],
          "content": "**(c) The first person’s number is ‘0’.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.162,
            0.459,
            0.834,
            0.501
          ],
          "content": "**(d) If a person is not first or last in line (i.e., if they are standing somewhere in between), then they cannot say ‘0’.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.162,
            0.504,
            0.83,
            0.524
          ],
          "content": "**(e) The person who calls out the largest number is the shortest.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.16,
            0.526,
            0.826,
            0.548
          ],
          "content": "**(f) What is the largest number possible in a group of 8 people?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.549,
            0.17,
            0.565
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Ans:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.569,
            0.421,
            0.587
          ],
          "content": "(a) Only sometimes true"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.591,
            0.337,
            0.61
          ],
          "content": "(b) Always true"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.613,
            0.337,
            0.632
          ],
          "content": "(c) Always true"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.162,
            0.635,
            0.421,
            0.655
          ],
          "content": "(d) Only sometimes true"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.658,
            0.421,
            0.677
          ],
          "content": "(e) Only sometimes true"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.162,
            0.679,
            0.744,
            0.7
          ],
          "content": "(f) The largest possible number in a group of 8 people is 7"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.749,
            0.251,
            0.767
          ],
          "level": 2,
